        {
            "number": 3,
            "revision": "6f246ce7d849249eda241207931100029999af9f",
            "parents": [
                "1a2564f920cf4b8ba9c7c5edc5d448314d841682"
            ],
            "ref": "refs/changes/54/90754/3",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "cchoux",
                "email": "cosmo.chou@quantatw.com",
                "username": "cchoux"
            },
            "createdOn": 1780365555,
            "author": {
                "name": "cchoux",
                "email": "cosmo.chou@quantatw.com",
                "username": "cchoux"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "What is the race condition and why do we have it?\n\ncc: @paligill@gmail.com\n\nI'm afraid if we have a \"race condition\" on Yv5 we probably have that same race condition everywhere.  That should be solved by the underlying repositories rather than needing to be hacked around by every platform."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "cchoux",
                        "email": "cosmo.chou@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "cchoux"
                    },
                    "message": "The race condition occurs between psusensor (telemetry polling + driver probing via sysfs) and I2CVR initialization on D-Bus.\r\nCurrent patches addressing the racing issues:\r\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/83968\r\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-bmc-code-mgmt/+/85233\r\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-bmc-code-mgmt/+/88985\r\nHowever, these do not yet cover the timing where psusensor triggers driver probing via sysfs."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite5/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/wait-vr-fw",
                    "line": 22,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Doesn't this make it so that a platform that doesn't have a CXL has to wait 30 seconds to boot?  Is there something we can do to make T1 systems not wait this long?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite5/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/wait-vr-fw",
                    "line": 22,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "cchoux",
                        "email": "cosmo.chou@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "cchoux"
                    },
                    "message": "AFAIK, T1 also has CXL boards (the same boards with T2).\nAdded checking CXL presence (PRSNT_CXL_N) in case T1 has a configuration without CXL."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite5/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors_%.bbappend",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "We shouldn't be defining new PACKAGECONFIG in bbappend files.  Use a raw variable."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-yosemite5/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors_%.bbappend",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "cchoux",
                        "email": "cosmo.chou@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "cchoux"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
